  "details": "I've noticed that you can't block a group if the group has banned you.\n\nWhen attempting to block a group that has banned you, the big red block button on the blocking dialogue does not respond to a click.\n\nI think people should be able to block any group they wish regardless of their ban status from that group.\n\nSending this as a website bug since far as I can see there is no way to block groups in-game (or if there is it only exists as a response option I'd guess).\n\nEdit: I realize that I left this uncategorized, oops. I can't change it now, so I hope a mod can sort it. Honestly I'm not sure if this should be categorized as a bug or as a request anyway.\n\nThanks.",
